{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_st03",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st03",
  "title": "行走於大地之上",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9e717147a850f6c5378ee6180f892e318a7eb42aaef3fe1f9e877784651b6f2c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝你們的付出，寇恩、科茨、蒂娜、亞歷山大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我謹代表......長泉鎮的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我還不太擅長使用這種措辭和人說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多虧了你們，我才能從弟弟手裡活下來，我的領民也能重新回到自己的土地上生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這只是我們應該做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們引發了這場危機，所以我們有義務將其終結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是我那無可救藥的弟弟，一切都不會發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本想為你們準備報酬的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，如你們所見，整個長泉鎮已經毀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剩下的資產，我想全部投入到鎮子的復興上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現金酬勞......可能沒法支付給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這座房子裡，只要有你們想要的東西，儘管拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最好把它全拆了搬走，這樣我就能和活下來的人一起建造新的長泉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "關於這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "亞歷山大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "這頭盔挺合身的，我能留著嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "的確，甲片亮到能閃瞎眼睛，我想給盾上也安一個，以後就用不著電池了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這件事情的結果，我們都很滿意，已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這，不需要更多的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的武器、父親的其他收藏，你們都可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不用這麼客氣，你或許更需要這些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "走吧各位，我們該離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "科茨先生，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們終於出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "和領主小姐道別完了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "那我們也該離開這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的小隊會護送你們回島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "有勞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寇恩小姐，您的小隊將會與我們同行，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "是，我和我的隊員已經戰鬥太久了，他們需要一個能夠休息和進行補給的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "最重要的，我們可能需要身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "一個行走在這個世界……不，行走在這片“大地”上的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "車已經就位了，我們出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "各位的資訊已經錄入羅德島終端了，以後可以在大地各處的羅德島辦事處或安全屋進行逗留與補給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "雖然各位並非羅德島的正式雇員，但任務網路已向各位開放，各位可以透過承接任務來獲得報酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "大致情況就是這樣，各位還有什麼想要知道的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "稍等，我能問一問，羅德島上有哪兒能看到科幻小說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "所以，這就是我們的新身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "至少我的盾能用了，還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "有什麼計劃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "嘗試去看看這片大地吧，我們對這個世界還瞭解得太少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我也希望能有份詳盡的計劃書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "但這一次，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們只能依靠自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "所以我們的第一個目的地是哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有一個叫汐斯塔的地方，聽起來是個很不錯的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "那就走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "在回到家之前，我們終究還在路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
